    <bpmn:process id="W_W4513" name="W4513. Community-Needs Assessment &amp; Partnership Identification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4505); community signal; periodic cycle
Frequency: Annual + on opportunity
Volume: Needs assessment across 200 store communities
Owner: Foundation ED / Programs / Consumer Insights (VS-44)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), Govt Affairs (VS-104), Insights (VS-44), Research
Source: workflow W4513 — Community-Needs Assessment &amp; Partnership Identification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4513_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4513_Lane1" name="Programs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4513_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4513_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4513_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4513_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4513_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4513_Start3" name="Strategy (W4505); community signal; periodic cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4513_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4513_Task4" name="Programs/Foundation ED conduct community-needs assessment (shelter, livelihood…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Programs/Foundation ED conduct community-needs assessment (shelter, livelihood, education, disaster-resilience gaps) leveraging store-community network (VS-07) and insights (VS-44)
Responsible (R): Programs / Insights / Stores
Accountable (A): Foundation ED
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4513_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4513_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4513_Task5" name="Programs/Partnerships identify credible partners (NGOs, LGUs, cooperatives…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Programs/Partnerships identify credible partners (NGOs, LGUs, cooperatives, faith groups) per need, with due diligence (W4509) and alignment to strategy pillars
Responsible (R): Programs / Partnerships
Accountable (A): Foundation ED
Duration: Per opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4513_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4513_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4513_Task6" name="Programs/Foundation ED prioritize &amp; sequence interventions by need/impact/fit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Programs/Foundation ED prioritize &amp; sequence interventions by need/impact/fit, and feed to program design (W4514–W4517) and budget (W4508)
Responsible (R): Programs / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): Foundation Board Programs Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4513_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4513_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4513_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4513_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4513_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-687 (ensure controlled execution — Community Investment, Disaster Response &amp; Volunteer Programs (PA-152.2).) | - CTL-687: needs community-driven (VS-44/VS-07); partners due-diligenced (W4509); priorities strategy-aligned (W4505)
Owner: Foundation ED / Programs / Consumer Insights (VS-44)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4513_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4513_Annotation8" targetRef="W4513_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
