    <bpmn:process id="W_W4514" name="W4514. Housing, Shelter &amp; &quot;Home Building Partner&quot; Community Programs" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Housing need; disaster (VS-69/W4517); partnership
Frequency: Per program cycle
Volume: Housing/shelter builds &amp; repairs in BuildRight communities
Owner: Foundation ED / Programs / Green Building (VS-78)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), Installation (VS-12), Logistics (VS-06), Volunteers (W4518)
Source: workflow W4514 — Housing, Shelter &amp; &quot;Home Building Partner&quot; Community Programs</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4514_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4514_Lane1" name="Programs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4514_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4514_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4514_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4514_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4514_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4514_Start3" name="Housing need; disaster (VS-69/W4517); partnership">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4514_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4514_Task4" name="Programs/Foundation ED design the housing/shelter program (home-build…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Programs/Foundation ED design the housing/shelter program (home-build, home-repair, community-shelter), leveraging BuildRight&#x27;s category mastery (lumber/cement/tiles profile §6.2) and green-building advisory (VS-78)
Responsible (R): Programs / Foundation ED / Green Building
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4514_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4514_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4514_Task5" name="Programs/Logistics/Installation execute (material sourcing VS-03, logistics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Programs/Logistics/Installation execute (material sourcing VS-03, logistics VS-06, build/install VS-12, volunteer labor W4518), with HSE on site (VS-24/W4511)
Responsible (R): Programs / Logistics / Installation / Volunteers
Accountable (A): Foundation ED
Duration: Per build</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4514_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4514_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4514_Task6" name="Programs/Foundation ED hand over homes/shelters, capture beneficiary outcomes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Programs/Foundation ED hand over homes/shelters, capture beneficiary outcomes (W4521), and transition to livelihood/maintenance support (W4515)
Responsible (R): Programs / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Per closeout</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4514_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4514_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4514_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4514_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4514_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-687 (ensure controlled execution — Community Investment, Disaster Response &amp; Volunteer Programs (PA-152.2).) | - CTL-687: build quality to standard (VS-12/VS-78); HSE on site (VS-24); beneficiary selection transparent; outcomes measured (W4521)
Owner: Foundation ED / Programs / Green Building (VS-78)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4514_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4514_Annotation8" targetRef="W4514_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
