    <bpmn:process id="W_W4515" name="W4515. Livelihood, Skills &amp; Cooperative Development Programs" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Livelihood need; partnership (VS-94); skills gap
Frequency: Per program cycle
Volume: Livelihood/cooperative beneficiaries across communities
Owner: Foundation ED / Programs / Apprenticeship (VS-123)
Participants: Cooperative sourcing (VS-94), Trade program (VS-43), L&amp;D (VS-19.4), MSME (VS-82)
Source: workflow W4515 — Livelihood, Skills &amp; Cooperative Development Programs</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4515_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4515_Lane1" name="Programs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4515_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4515_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4515_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4515_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4515_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4515_Start3" name="Livelihood need; partnership (VS-94); skills gap">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4515_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4515_Task4" name="Programs/Foundation ED design livelihood programs (trade skills…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Programs/Foundation ED design livelihood programs (trade skills, micro-enterprise, cooperative formation) leveraging apprenticeship (VS-123) and trade know-how (VS-43), with market linkage
Responsible (R): Programs / Apprenticeship / Trade
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4515_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4515_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4515_Task5" name="Programs/Cooperative support cooperative/community-enterprise formation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Programs/Cooperative support cooperative/community-enterprise formation (onboard to VS-94 as suppliers where fit — virtuous loop), and provide skills training (VS-19.4)
Responsible (R): Programs / Cooperative / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Foundation ED
Duration: Per cohort</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4515_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4515_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4515_Task6" name="Programs/Foundation ED measure livelihood outcomes (income, enterprise survival…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Programs/Foundation ED measure livelihood outcomes (income, enterprise survival — W4521) and connect viable micro-enterprises to the MSME program (VS-82)
Responsible (R): Programs / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): Foundation Board
Duration: Per closeout</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4515_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4515_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4515_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4515_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
