        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-687 (ensure controlled execution — Community Investment, Disaster Response &amp; Volunteer Programs (PA-152.2).) | - CTL-687: livelihood programs market-linked (VS-94/VS-82); outcomes measured (W4521); exit/sustainability designed
Owner: Foundation ED / Programs / Apprenticeship (VS-123)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
