    <bpmn:process id="W_W4520" name="W4520. In-Kind Donation, Product-Giving &amp; Logistics Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program/disaster need; product-giving decision; inventory write-off candidate
Frequency: Per need + periodic
Volume: In-kind product donations (building materials, tools, relief goods)
Owner: Foundation ED / Supply Chain (VS-06) / Merchandising (VS-01)
Participants: Logistics (VS-06), DC (VS-04), Inventory (VS-05), Finance (VS-17), Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4520 — In-Kind Donation, Product-Giving &amp; Logistics Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4520_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4520_Lane1" name="Foundation ED">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4520_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4520_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4520_Lane2" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4520_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4520_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4520_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4520_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4520_Start5" name="Program/disaster need; product-giving decision; inventory write-off candidate">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4520_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4520_Task6" name="Foundation ED/Merchandising identify in-kind donation sources (excess/clearance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Foundation ED/Merchandising identify in-kind donation sources (excess/clearance inventory VS-64, vendor-donated product, program materials), coordinated with inventory disposition (VS-05.3)
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / Merchandising / Inventory
Accountable (A): Foundation Board / VP Merch
Duration: Per need</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4520_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4520_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4520_Task7" name="Logistics/DC execute donation logistics (pick/pack/ship to community —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics/DC execute donation logistics (pick/pack/ship to community — VS-06/VS-04), with HSE on DG/safe transport (VS-114) and tracking to beneficiary (W4521)
Responsible (R): Logistics / DC / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): Foundation ED / Logistics Manager
Duration: Per donation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4520_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4520_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4520_Task8" name="Finance/Tax account the donation (inventory relief, donation valuation, BIR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Tax account the donation (inventory relief, donation valuation, BIR deductible-receipt W4506) per VS-17/VS-79, and report in-kind value to the board
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO / Foundation Board
Duration: Per donation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4520_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4520_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4520_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4520_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4520_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-687 (ensure controlled execution — Community Investment, Disaster Response &amp; Volunteer Programs (PA-152.2).) | - CTL-687: donations tracked to beneficiary (W4521); DG safely transported (VS-114); valued &amp; receipted (VS-79/W4506)
Owner: Foundation ED / Supply Chain (VS-06) / Merchandising (VS-01)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
